# Canonical line endings.
#
# The repository stores LF and checks out LF on every platform, so Windows,
# macOS, Linux, and the ubuntu-latest CI runners all see byte-identical files.
# Without this, `core.autocrlf` on Windows makes every tracked file appear
# modified and lets CRLF/BOM corruption reach a commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
